          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "No trauma, weight loss, fever, sweats, systemic symptoms, focal neurological symptoms (including weakness, numbness, or sphincter change), chest pain, shortness of breath, abdominal pain, headache, or visual change. Appetite is okay."
